replay = "distribution.go remains byte-identical, pinned by its original SHA-256. Fixture done heights 10/20/30/40 exercise the boundaries of v5.5.2/v5.5.5/v5.6.2/v7.0 without asserting those synthetic heights are mainnet heights."
baseline = "No additional baseline run: the explicit gate order requires complete implementation then hf-build then hf-done, and forbids running verify_cmd by hand first. The carried qualification below records the earlier compile failure; no baseline assertion failure is claimed."
