gotcha = "The scoped graph excludes most source packages, so cg files/grep can return no hits for existing dependencies; use direct read-only source inspection after graph discovery. Task-specific gate ordering takes precedence over the contradictory baseline-run step."
continuation_gotcha = "The fresh attempt has no /out/run/gates.jsonl until its first gate; previous-attempt evidence remains in this record and the task ruling. The keepers bundle is declared in precompiles/utils/expected_keepers.go, not keepers.go."
boundary_repair = "The first continuation verify found that v5.6.2 has no Precompile type: its constructor returns common/legacy/v562.DynamicGasPrecompile. The boundary assertion now uses that declared wrapper and additionally requires the exact instance registered under each selected version; all state-diff and live-refusal assertions remain intact."
fixture_repair = "Construct the real account, bank, staking, distribution, upgrade and EVM keepers directly on a fresh MemDB; create the validator through the production staking message server and distribution hooks. The committed EmptyKeepers bundle supplies unused domains only; the two constructor getters used here return the real distribution and EVM keepers. Fund distribution by minting through the authorized EVM module and transferring, because distribution has no minter permission. All original assertions remain intact."

